BLOCKS NEEDED to certify a summed effect of a given size (CI excluding zero).
"resolve" = smallest n with CI95 half-width < the effect, i.e. an observed
  point estimate AT the target would have a CI that excludes zero (~50 % power).
"80 % power" = smallest n with effect >= (t.975 + t.80) * sd / sqrt(n).
